  "content": "<p>这是一个外部REI模块，用于添加对JEI插件的支持。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在Forge上使用REI遇到问题了吗？想知道它在整合包中的表现如何？来我们的Discord聊天吧！&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/4jrUbG4HN2\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/4jrUbG4HN2</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模组必须与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items Forge</a>一起使用。</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LrVLC2a.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://crowdin.com/project/roughly-enough-items/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2X5V8hc.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>请不要在评论区寻求支持，支持服务在Discord服务器中提供！</strong></span></p>",
